@startuml product-search

title Product Search Flow

actor User
participant "API\n(Endpoint)" as API
participant "ElasticsearchProductSearcher" as Searcher
participant "EmbeddingClient\n(OpenAI)" as Embedding
participant "Elasticsearch" as ES

== Search with Keyword (Hybrid Search) ==

User -> API : GET /products/search\n?keyword=xxx&categoryId=&minPrice=&maxPrice=&isActive=&page=&pageSize=
API -> Searcher : SearchAsync(ProductSearchQuery)

Searcher -> Embedding : GetEmbeddingAsync(keyword)
note right: 將 keyword 轉成 1024 維向量
Embedding --> Searcher : float[] queryVector

Searcher -> ES : SearchAsync\n(\n  kNN: field=embedding, queryVector, k=size*5, numCandidates=100\n  query: bool.must MultiMatch(name, description)\n  filter: isActive / price range / categoryId\n)
note right
  Hybrid Search：
  kNN（語意搜尋）+ BM25（關鍵字搜尋）
  ES 自動合併兩者分數排序
  embedding 欄位從 source 中排除（不回傳）
end note

ES --> Searcher : SearchResponse<ProductSearchDocument>
Searcher --> API : ProductSearchResponse
API --> User : 200\n{ page, pageSize, totalCount, totalPages,\n  items[{ productId, categoryId, name, description,\n          price, stockQuantity, isActive, primaryImageUrl }] }

== Search without Keyword (Filter Only) ==

User -> API : GET /products/search\n?categoryId=&minPrice=&maxPrice=&isActive=&page=&pageSize=
API -> Searcher : SearchAsync(ProductSearchQuery)

Searcher -> ES : SearchAsync\n(\n  query: bool.must MatchAll + filter\n  sort: createdAt DESC\n)

ES --> Searcher : SearchResponse<ProductSearchDocument>
Searcher --> API : ProductSearchResponse
API --> User : 200 ProductSearchResponse

== Index Sync (Product Created / Updated) ==

note over ES
  Outbox → Kafka → ProductIndexOutboxEventHandler
  → UpsertProductAsync(productId)
end note

participant "ProductSearchIndexSynchronizer" as Sync
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB

Sync -> DB : GetByIdAsync(productId)\n→ Product + Variants + Skus + Images + Tags
Sync -> DB : Query Category.Name
Sync -> DB : Query Tag.Names

Sync -> Sync : BuildEmbeddingText(\n  name, description, categoryName,\n  colors, tagNames, audience\n)
note right
  向量化欄位（組合成一段文字再向量化）：
  ┌────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┐
  │ 欄位           │ 說明                             │
  ├────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┤
  │ name           │ 商品名稱                         │
  │ description    │ 商品描述                         │
  │ categoryName   │ 分類名稱                         │
  │ colors         │ 所有 variant 顏色（空格分隔）    │
  │ tagNames       │ 所有標籤名稱（空格分隔）         │
  │ audience       │ 受眾：男 / 女                    │
  └────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────┘
  組合範例：
  "Air Force 1. 經典低筒球鞋. 球鞋. 白色 紅色. 運動 休閒. 男"
end note

Sync -> Embedding : GetEmbeddingAsync(embeddingText)
Embedding --> Sync : float[1024] embedding

Sync -> ES : IndexAsync(ProductSearchDocument)\n{\n  productId, categoryId,\n  name       → text (BM25)\n  description→ text (BM25)\n  price      → float (最低 SKU 價格)\n  stockQuantity → int (所有 SKU 庫存加總)\n  isActive   → boolean\n  createdAt  → date\n  embedding  → dense_vector(1024, cosine)\n}

== Index Sync (Product Deleted) ==

note over ES
  Outbox → Kafka → ProductIndexOutboxEventHandler
  → DeleteProductAsync(productId)
end note

Sync -> ES : DeleteAsync(productId)

== Startup: Index Initialization ==

participant "EsIndexInitializer" as Init
participant "ProductReindexer" as Reindexer

Init -> ES : Indices.ExistsAsync(indexName)

alt Index 不存在
  Init -> ES : Indices.CreateAsync\n(mapping: keyword / text / float / bool / date / dense_vector)
  Init -> Reindexer : ReindexAsync(batchSize=500)
  note right: 分批從 DB 撈所有 product\n逐一 UpsertProductAsync
else Index 已存在
  Init -> ES : Indices.PutMappingAsync\n(更新 embedding dense_vector mapping)
end

@enduml
